  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4305.02 Methods and Schedules for Performance and Compliance Testing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4305.02 Methods and Schedules for Performance and Compliance Testing. Performance testing at all existing OSWI units shall be conducted:\n\n(a) On the schedule in 40 CFR §§60.3033 through 60.3035; and\n\n(b) In accordance with 40 CFR §60.3027.\n\nSource. #10765, eff 1-22-15; ss by #14248, eff 5-20-25, EXPIRES: 5-20-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a4300.html"
